.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd October 23, 2026
.Dt WSCONSCTL.CONF 5
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm wsconsctl.conf
.Nd console settings made at boot
.Sh DESCRIPTION
At boot,
.Pa /etc/rc.d/wsconsctl
runs
.Xr wsconsctl 8
once for each line of
.Pa /etc/wsconsctl.conf :
a
.Ar name Ns = Ns Ar value
setting, as
.Nm wsconsctl
takes it.
Empty lines and lines starting with
.Ql #
are skipped, as is anything after the first word of a line.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/wsconsctl.conf -compact
.It Pa /etc/wsconsctl.conf
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
keyboard.encoding=de		# a German keyboard
display.palette=rust		# the console in rust colours
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr wsconsctl 8
